    lead:"<!-- altwwii-writer-block:start id=wb-g-20260816-c6l3r writer=g kind=revision created=2026-08-16T11:36:00-06:00 -->Consolidated's PBY and B-24 work are inherited pre-divergence history.<sup class='canon-note' data-provenance='p'>[p]</sup> The author directly establishes B-58 Hustlers in the Maracaibo losses, but Convair manufacture, the F-102/F-106 delta lineage, the alternate B-58 service history, and the later spacecraft company are incorporated reconstruction.<sup class='canon-note' data-provenance='e'>[e]</sup><!-- altwwii-writer-block:end -->",
